# Overall-sales-profit-category-insights
Power BI dasbord
         Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing overall business sales performance using Power BI. The dashboard provides a consolidated view of Sales, Profit, Quantity, Category performance, Regional contribution, Customer segments, and Monthly trends, enabling data-driven decision-making for business stakeholders.
         Tools & Technologies
-Power BI Desktop
-Data Modeling & DAX
-Interactive Visualizations
-Filters & Slicers
         Key Steps Performed
1-Data Cleaning & Preparation
2-Data Modeling
3-Measure Creation (DAX)
4-Dashboard Design
         Outcome
This dashboard provides a 360-degree view of business performance, helping stakeholders:
Track KPIs efficiently
Identify high-profit categories
Understand customer behavior
Make informed strategic decisions
